  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味と　塩味が　強い　食材。ガケガニの　脱皮したあとの　殻のエキスが配合された　ヘルシーな　加工食品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛과 짠맛이 강한 식재료. 절벼게의 탈피하고 남은 껍데기의 진액을 배합해서 만든 건강한 가공식품.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甜味和鹹味強勁的食材。加入了由毛崖蟹脫下的殼提煉之精華，是有益健康的加工食品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé et sucré. Une préparation industrielle saine créée à partir d’une substance extraite des carapaces laissées par des Craparoi après leur mue.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein industriell verarbeitetes Lebensmittel, das sehr süß und salzig ist. Diese nahrhafte Zutat ist mit einem Konzentrat aus abgeworfenen Klibbe-Schalen versetzt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un nutritivo alimento procesado con un fuerte sabor dulce y salado a la vez, elaborado a partir del extracto de las mudas de caparazón de Klawf.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto dolce e salato. È un cibo nutriente ottenuto tramite processo industriale dall’essenza estratta dai carapaci lasciati dai Klawf dopo la muta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very sweet and salty ingredient. It’s a nutritious processed food made with a concentrate derived from shed Klawf shells.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
